    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've talked to people. they just tell me to \"breathe\" or \"give it time,\" like that's actually going to fix this. it feels like a joke. i'm not looking for a new management technique, i'm just... i'm so tired of existing in this noise. i just want to know if there's even a version of life that isn't this. is there ever actually going to be real silence?",
